/* UI/GuardrailsPane.swift */
"HTTPS inspection is off, so Flowlight can't read the tool list — nothing here is being carried out yet." = "HTTPS 檢查已關閉，Flowlight 無法讀取工具列表 — 這裡的設定還沒有生效。";
"An agent re-sends its whole tool list on every turn. Switching a tool off here removes it from that list before the model ever sees it — so there is no refusal to argue with and no retry loop. For MCP servers reached over HTTP, a refused call is answered here too, with a sentence the model can read." = "代理每一輪都會重新送出完整的工具列表。在這裡關閉某個工具，會在模型看到那份列表之前就先把它移除 — 所以沒有拒絕訊息可以爭論，也不會出現重試循環。對於透過 HTTP 連線的 MCP 伺服器，被拒絕的呼叫也會在這裡得到回應，並附上一句模型讀得懂的說明。";
"MCP servers" = "MCP 伺服器";
"never yet" = "還沒有過";
"Refuse a tool by name or pattern, e.g. write*" = "依名稱或樣式拒絕工具，例如 write*";
"This is not a sandbox." = "這不是沙箱。";
"A refused tool stops being offered to the model and stops being answered. An agent that still has a shell can do by hand what the tool would have done — Flowlight will record that, but it can't stop it. Local MCP servers speak over pipes, which no proxy can see: what Flowlight can do there is watch the server's own network traffic, which is already attributed to the agent that started it, and offer to write the agent's own deny list." = "被拒絕的工具不會再提供給模型，也不會再得到回應。若代理仍然有 shell 可用，它還是能自己動手做到那個工具原本要做的事 — Flowlight 會把這件事記錄下來，但無法阻止。本機的 MCP 伺服器透過管道通訊，任何代理伺服器都看不到：Flowlight 在那裡能做的，是監看該伺服器自己的網路流量（這些流量已經歸給啟動它的代理），並協助你寫出代理本身的拒絕清單。";

