"Answer a chosen endpoint yourself instead of letting the request reach the server — a 500, a rate limit, a malformed body, or a long wait — and watch what the agent does about it." = "由你自己回應選定的端點，而不讓請求送到伺服器 — 一個 500、一次速率限制、一段格式錯誤的內文，或是長時間的等待 — 然後看代理會怎麼處理。";
"Only requests Flowlight decrypts can be mocked. Hosts that are tunnelled — the never-decrypted list, apps that pin their certificates, anything not routed through the proxy — are never touched by a rule." = "只有 Flowlight 會解密的請求才能被模擬。以通道方式通過的主機 — 永不解密清單、使用憑證綁定的 App、以及任何不經過代理伺服器的流量 — 都不會被規則影響。";
"HTTPS inspection is off, so nothing is decrypted and no rule can answer anything yet." = "HTTPS 檢查已關閉，因此不會解密任何內容，目前也沒有規則能回應任何請求。";
"No mock rules." = "沒有模擬規則。";
"Rules are tried from the top; the first enabled one that matches answers." = "規則由上往下比對；第一個已啟用且符合的規則負責回應。";
"Add Rule…" = "加入規則…";
"Turn All Off" = "全部關閉";
"Optional, e.g. “GitHub is down”" = "選填，例如「GitHub is down」";
"Host" = "主機";
"api.example.com" = "api.example.com";
"Exactly that host. Write *.example.com to cover the domain and its subdomains." = "只符合該主機。輸入 *.example.com 可涵蓋該網域及其子網域。";
"Path" = "路徑";
"/v1/*" = "/v1/*";
"A glob: * matches any run of characters. The query string is ignored unless the pattern contains a ?." = "這是 glob 樣式：* 可符合任意一段字元。除非樣式中含有 ?，否則會忽略查詢字串。";
"Method" = "方法";
"Delay" = "延遲";
"seconds" = "秒";
"One Name: value per line. Content-Length and Connection are written by Flowlight." = "每行一組 Name: value。Content-Length 和 Connection 由 Flowlight 自行填寫。";
"Body" = "內文";

