/* UI/RuleEditor.swift */
"Then" = "則";
"Block it" = "封鎖";
"Allow it" = "允許";
"What it names" = "規則指名的對象";
"Any app — or a name, or a bundle identifier" = "任何 App — 或輸入名稱、Bundle ID";
"Anywhere — or a domain, an IP address, or a range" = "任何地方 — 或輸入網域、IP 位址或範圍";
"A domain carries its subdomains with it: `example.com` covers `api.example.com`. Naming an agent covers the tools and MCP servers it started." = "網域會連帶包含其子網域：`example.com` 涵蓋 `api.example.com`。指名一個代理，則會涵蓋它啟動的工具和 MCP 伺服器。";
"For how long" = "持續多久";
"Lasts" = "持續";
"Forever" = "永久";
"Until a time" = "到某個時間為止";
"Between chosen hours" = "在指定的時段內";
"Gone when Flowlight quits, including a crash. Nothing is left behind in force." = "Flowlight 結束時就會消失，當掉也一樣，不會留下仍在生效的規則。";
"Any path — or /v1/*" = "任何路徑 — 或 /v1/*";
"Answer with" = "回應內容";
"A path can only be matched where the request can be read, which is HTTPS inspection. That is also what makes this the friendlier refusal: the agent gets a status it can read instead of a connection that died without saying why." = "只有在能讀取請求內容時才比對得到路徑，也就是要開啟 HTTPS 檢查。這也讓這種拒絕比較友善：代理會收到一個讀得懂的狀態，而不是一條莫名斷掉的連線。";
"One URL rather than the whole host" = "只針對一個 URL，而不是整台主機";
"Name an app or a destination — a rule that names neither would decide every connection on the Mac." = "請指名一個 App 或一個目標 — 兩者都沒有指名的規則會決定這台 Mac 上的每一條連線。";
" reaching " = " 連線到 ";
" requests from " = " 請求，來自 ";
" to " = " 到 ";

/* UI/RulesView.swift */
"Templates" = "範本";
