"Add Rule" = "加入規則";
"Write a rule: an app, an agent, a destination or a URL, blocked or allowed" = "寫一條規則：指定 App、代理、目標或 URL，並選擇封鎖或允許";
"Nothing is being refused. Click to start again now." = "目前沒有任何連線被拒絕。點按可立即恢復。";
