"Resume now" = "立即恢復";
"No rules yet" = "還沒有任何規則";
"A rule names something — an app, an agent, a destination, or a URL — and says block or allow. Right-click any row in Live, Reports, AI Agents or Inspect to write one about what you're looking at, or start from the library — it already knows which hosts a package install reaches, and which ones a file leaves by." = "一條規則會指名某個對象 — App、代理、目標或 URL — 並決定封鎖或允許。在「即時」、「報告」、「AI 代理」或「檢查」中對任一列按右鍵，就能針對你正在看的東西寫一條規則；也可以從範本庫開始 — 它已經知道安裝套件會連到哪些主機，以及檔案通常是從哪些主機離開的。";
"Browse Templates…" = "瀏覽範本…";
"Write One…" = "自己寫一條…";
"Nothing yet" = "還沒有任何項目";
"Every connection a rule decides lands here — the refusals, and the exceptions that let something through. The second half is how \"why is this getting through?\" stays answerable." = "每一條由規則決定的連線都會出現在這裡 — 被拒絕的，以及例外放行的。後者的存在，正是為了讓「為什麼這個還通得過？」始終有答案。";
"Edit…" = "編輯…";
"Reset Count" = "重設計數";
"Delete" = "刪除";
"Show the Rule…" = "顯示這條規則…";
"Everywhere" = "所有地方";
"For the next hour" = "接下來一小時";
"For every app" = "所有 App";
"Apply a Template" = "套用範本";
"Each one writes ordinary rules into the list, where they can be read, switched off or deleted like anything else. Refusing a connection is the Network Extension's job, so with the nettop sampler selected in Capture these are watched rather than carried out." = "每個範本都會把一般的規則寫進列表，你可以像對待其他規則一樣閱讀、關閉或刪除它們。拒絕連線是網路延伸功能的工作，所以當「擷取」中選用 nettop 取樣器時，這些規則只會被監看，不會實際執行。";
"Optional. Left empty this applies to everything on the Mac; naming an app narrows it to that app and the tools it started." = "選填。留空表示套用到這台 Mac 上的所有項目；指名某個 App 則會縮小到該 App 以及它啟動的工具。";
"A domain, an IP address, or a range" = "網域、IP 位址或範圍";
"Added" = "加入時間";
"A name, or a bundle identifier" = "名稱或 Bundle ID";

